  "question": "Where can I find a viewpoint inside a 140 kilometers cutoff in the northwest direction?",
  "sql": "\nWITH origin AS  (SELECT ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-81.845367 39.320973)',4326)::geography AS geometry)\nSELECT * FROM pois, origin\nWHERE ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-81.845367 39.320973)',4326)::geography, 140000)\nAND tourism = 'viewpoint'\nAND degrees(ST_Azimuth(origin.geometry, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN 292.5 AND 337.5;\n",
